{
  "name": "319. Cohere errors carry error_type and keep Cohere's status (cohere error type)",
  "description": "Pins contract C6 for Cohere: Cohere's error status reaches the client unchanged, and the error carries extra_fields.error_type from Cohere's own status table (docs.cohere.com/reference/errors). Cohere's v2 error body is a flat {\"id\", \"message\"}, so the status is what the type is read from. An unknown model is the error a live request can trigger deterministically: Cohere answers 404, which on chat and embeddings can only mean the model, so the type is caller_model_unknown on chat, Responses (and its stream) and embeddings (the generic rule would call a chat or Responses 404 caller_invalid_request).",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "[EXPECT-404] /v1/chat/completions - unknown model keeps Cohere's 404 and carries error_type caller_model_unknown - cohere/command-does-not-exist",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Cohere 404 on chat is returned as 404 with error_type caller_model_unknown', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'expected 404: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql(404);",
              "  var body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(body.extra_fields && body.extra_fields.error_type, 'extra_fields.error_type: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql('caller_model_unknown');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"cohere/command-does-not-exist\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 16,\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"hi\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "chat",
            "completions"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
